* M600 compound material
MATERIAL                           1.207                              M600
COMPOUND        5.69  HYDROGEN      3.96    CARBON       0.4  NITROGENM600
COMPOUND        0.85    OXYGEN                                        M600
* OGS compound material
MATERIAL                           1.091                              OGS
COMPOUND       0.456  HYDROGEN     0.532    CARBON     0.012   SILICONOGS
* PMMA phantom material
MATERIAL                            1.18                              PMMAnew
COMPOUND          5.    CARBON        8.  HYDROGEN        2.    OXYGENPMMAnew
* Silicate glass (fused quartz)
MATERIAL                           2.203                              GLASS
COMPOUND          1.   SILICON        2.    OXYGEN                    GLASS
* mgdraw .txt-file dumping
USERDUMP        100.       22.       0.0        1.                    USRDUMP
* Dose in PMMA phantom
*USRBIN           10.      DOSE      -23.       7.5       7.5       40.PMMADOSE
*USRBIN          -7.5      -7.5       0.0       60.       60.       80. &
* Dose in detector core
*USRBIN           10.      DOSE      -25.      76.7      12.5      32.2DTCCDOSE
*USRBIN         51.95     -12.3       7.7       50.       50.       50. &
* Photon fluence in detector core
*USRBIN           10.    PHOTON      -26.      76.7      12.5      32.2DTCCgFLU
*USRBIN         51.95     -12.3       7.7       50.       50.       50. &
* Neutron fluence in detector core
*USRBIN           10.   NEUTRON      -27.      76.7      12.5      32.2DTCCnFLU
*USRBIN         51.95     -12.3       7.7       50.       50.       50. &
* Set the random number seed
RANDOMIZ          1.741511143.
START        150000.
STOP
